<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "10A">
<servcat sctnbr = "10" scnbr = "01">
<configtype typenbr = "2">
<servinfotype sitcode = "1">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0AA121006" svcinfotypenbr = "03" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Description of Speed Limiter System Components and Functions
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "1.287in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "5.905in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Component
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Function
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
ECM and electric throttle body
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
ECM performs speed limiter control based on the signal from cruise control switch.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
ECM controls electric throttle valve opening not to exceed the maximum speed set by the driver.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
APP sensor
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
Detects depressing degree of the accelerator pedal.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
LIMIT switch
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
This switch has a momentary contact type button to turn speed limiter function ON and OFF.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
SET/– switch
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Current vehicle speed is inputted as the maximum speed when this switch is pressed (ON). If the vehicle speed is 30 km/h (20 mile/h) or less, the maximum speed is set at 30 km/h (20 mile/h), and if the vehicle speed is higher than 240 km/h (150 mile/h), the maximum speed is set at 240 km/h (150 mile/h) and the vehicle speed is decelerated to the maximum speed.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When this switch is pressed (ON) while the speed limiter system is functioning, the maximum speed decreases. The maximum speed can be changed when the vehicle speed is at 0 km/h (0 mile/h).
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
RES/+ switch
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
When this switch is pressed (ON) after cancellation of the speed limiter control, the system resumes functioning with the speed before the cancellation.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When this switch is pressed (ON) while the speed limiter system is functioning, the maximum speed increases. The maximum speed can be changed when the vehicle speed is at 0 km/h (0 mile/h).
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
CANCEL switch
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
When this switch is pressed (ON), the speed limiter control is canceled.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
“LIMIT” indicator
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
In the state with ignition “ON” and speed limiter system in OFF, pressing LIMIT switch once and releasing it will activate the speed limiter system and ECM will cause indicator to light up.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
“SET” indicator
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
Lights up when the speed limiter system is functioning.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
Information display
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Maximum speed is displayed while the speed limiter system is functioning.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Maximum speed display blinks when the vehicle speed exceeds the maximum speed.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
Warning buzzer (in combination meter)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
Warning buzzer sounds when the vehicle speed exceeds the preset maximum speed.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
